Convert and inspect ProXDR and Motion Photo assets with the canonical Rust runtime.

Usage: xdremux <COMMAND>

Commands:
  inspect     Inspect one input without converting it
  convert     Convert one supported source with the unified Rust engine/runtime
  batch       Convert a deterministic batch of supported assets
  categorize  Classify photo assets and publish them into deterministic folders
  validate    Validate one canonical output without converting it

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
